@call r12 arrest_radio start=05:10:00
@patient age=58 sex=male weight_kg=100 complaint="cardiac arrest" allergies=unknown home_meds=unknown history=unknown
@traps ventricular fibrillation
RD: Medic 1, CPR in progress, 58 male, 22 Oak Lane.  >> dispatch:CPR in progress "CPR in progress"
M1: Medic 1, on location.  >> time:eTimes.06 "on location"
M2: Pulseless, pads on, shockable.  >> proc:defibrillation pads "pads on"
TAP button +label
M1: Shock 200 joules.  >> proc:defibrillation "Shock 200 joules"
M2: Compressions resumed.  >> proc:CPR "Compressions"
TAP button +label
M1: IO right tibia.  >> proc:IO access "IO right tibia"
TAP button +label
M1: Epi 1 milligram IO.  >> med:epinephrine,1,mg,IO "Epi 1 milligram IO"
TAP button -
GAP 10
M2: Still shockable, shocking.  >> proc:defibrillation "shocking"
TAP button +label
M1: Amiodarone 300 IO.  >> med:amiodarone,300,,IO "Amiodarone 300 IO"
GAP 10
M2: I-gel in, ETCO2 22.  >> proc:supraglottic airway "I-gel"; vital:etco2=22 "ETCO2 22"
GAP 10
M1: Second epi, 1 milligram.  >> med:epinephrine,1,mg, "Second epi, 1 milligram"
GAP 10
M2: Pulse check. We have a pulse, rate 104, ETCO2 41.  >> vital:hr=104 "rate 104"; vital:etco2=41 "ETCO2 41"
TAP button -
M1: Medic 1 transporting to Mercy, priority three.  >> time:eTimes.09 "transporting"
M1: Mercy, Medic 1, ROSC, 58 male, two shocks, epi times two, amiodarone 300, I-gel, ETCO2 41.
M1: Arriving Mercy.  >> time:eTimes.11 "Arriving Mercy"
